  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP Ext. Engmnt Campaign &amp; In-UNDP-HQ-00130377</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP External Engagement Campaign Climate and Inequality themes on climate and nature, inequality and gender inequality, and crisis and conflict - continue to drive internal cooperation and external coherence in positioning UNDP, amplifying our voice on critical, complex issues. The external engagement campaign will have four essential workstreams; the creative idea, the digital eco-system which will house the campaign, the call to action and the communications and publicity campaign.</narrative>
  </description>
